<title>SWITZERLAND: Kuoni increases stake in charter airline.</title>
<headline>Kuoni increases stake in charter airline.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss travel and tour group Kuoni Reisen AG said it increased its stake in charter airline Edelweiss Air to 62 percent from 33 percent.</p>
<p>Kuoni said the increase was the result of the purchase of the shares owned by Theo Karabatis of Athens, who also stepped down from the Edelweiss board.</p>
<p>In addition, Kuoni said the charter airline, which began operations in February, is obtaining another MD 83 jet, which increases the size of its fleet to three aircraft.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
